        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "3. Loss of military membership results in separation from technician service after a 30-day notice. However, in accordance with applicable laws and government wide regulations, applicants for NG Special Disability Retirement Provisions may remain working in a technician duty status, or request annual leave, sick leave, or leave-without-pay (LWOP) status until receipt of OPM's initial decision on the disability application.",
